      "content": "SP 90 NW                   CHARTRIDGE           BELLINGDON                                                 (West Side) 2/10                          \t\t        Range of two Barns and                                                 attached Outbuildings to                                                 east of Huge Farmhouse - GV                                              II Barns and outbuildings C18 and C19 altered. Timber framed with modern brick infill, some colourwashed old tile roofs.  Barn to south has projecting gabled wagon - entry on south; 3 bays, posts with straight braces and raking queenposts.  1-bay wing to north, 3-bay stable linking to northern barn which has gabled projection on its north side, 4 bays with trusses of similar design.  Lower C19 block connects with north west end of the house. Listing NGR: SP9446205046"
    }
